          <declname>Val</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Obtain the first use of a value. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Uses are obtained in an iterator fashion. First, call this function to obtain a reference to the first use. Then, call <ref refid="group___l_l_v_m_c_core_value_uses_1ga6ea72661bcca2b77bea57173317ec942" kindref="member">LLVMGetNextUse()</ref> on that instance and all subsequently obtained instances until <ref refid="group___l_l_v_m_c_core_value_uses_1ga6ea72661bcca2b77bea57173317ec942" kindref="member">LLVMGetNextUse()</ref> returns NULL.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_value_1a413abcab8dbc3900fc2fde96a5d8fca6" kindref="member">llvm::Value::use_begin()</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
