    <briefdescription>
<para>This module defines functions that allow you to inspect the uses of a <ref refid="group___l_l_v_m_c_support_types_1ga113ce952344691b8304a43a314f8be17" kindref="member">LLVMValueRef</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>It is possible to obtain an <ref refid="group___l_l_v_m_c_support_types_1gab30423fe4582af30d65061fddc7398d7" kindref="member">LLVMUseRef</ref> for any <ref refid="group___l_l_v_m_c_support_types_1ga113ce952344691b8304a43a314f8be17" kindref="member">LLVMValueRef</ref> instance. Each <ref refid="group___l_l_v_m_c_support_types_1gab30423fe4582af30d65061fddc7398d7" kindref="member">LLVMUseRef</ref> (which corresponds to a <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_use" kindref="compound">llvm::Use</ref> instance) holds a <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_user" kindref="compound">llvm::User</ref> and <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_value" kindref="compound">llvm::Value</ref>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
